TETRA MagentaStation

Derived from TETRA BlueStation by Wouter Bokslag / Midnight Blue and its
contributors: https://github.com/MidnightBlueLabs/tetra-bluestation
MS extraction source: https://github.com/misadeks/tetra-bluestation
Source base revision: 69a3533, plus the supplied portable-MS extraction snapshot.

The supplied root LICENSE contains the Apache License, Version 2.0. It is
retained verbatim. The supplied workspace Cargo metadata instead declared MIT;
no separate MIT license text or dual-license grant was present in the supplied
snapshot. MagentaStation metadata follows the shipped Apache-2.0 root license
and does not assert a new MIT or dual-license grant. This records the inherited
discrepancy rather than relicensing third-party work. Dependencies remain under
their respective licenses.

Modifications for this derivative:
- Separate portable MS types/protocol/coding libraries and optional C ABI.
- Retain MS desktop control, telemetry, provisioning, persistence, speech,
  SDR and explicit offline-management interfaces.
- Remove BS entities, scheduling, subscriber/backhaul/Brew integration, BS
  runtime selection/configuration and BS-only tests/examples.
- Rename the desktop application and revise documentation/CI for MS-only use.
- Retain existing external schema identifiers and upstream wire vocabulary.
- Recolor the original emblem-only contrib/logo/bluestation_noname.svg to
  #ff0066 as contrib/logo/magentastation.svg. Original geometry, transforms,
  transparency and Inkscape metadata are retained; no new artwork or wordmark
  is claimed.

